    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:30:32.141Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "ilionx is a Dutch integrator recorded with an Oracle, Microsoft and integration stack, and the assessment leaves its vertical mix unresolved. Of the two, the missing half is the more useful one: the stack says what the bench can do, the verticals say whether the sovereignty and audit arguments would land at all.\n\nSo the lead sits at priority 4 behind an open-source screen, while the screen is not actually the binding gap \u2014 the vertical mix is. This note records which question is outstanding so the next research pass asks the right one instead of repeating the posture check.\n\n---\n\n## Leads sharing this finding (1)\n\n**4 \u00b7 needs OSS screen**\n- ilionx (NL)\n\nVerbatim research text this claim was extracted from:\n\n> Vertical mix still unresolved.",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-19T11:30:32.141374Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:30:32.141380Z"
    }
  },
